@startuml
' Turritopsis ESG Diagnostic | repository inspection 2026-10-07
' Scope: Illustrative event order — no measured durations
' Evidence: backend/src/Modules/Turritopsis.Modules.Reviews.Core/Application/DossierService.cs; frontend/src/features/dossiers/pages/report/ReportPage.tsx
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #30465E
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F3F6FA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF5DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #C79C56
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide empty members
title Illustrative submission and review timing
robust "Live answers" as Answers
robust "Dossier record" as Dossier
robust "Report page" as Report
scale 10 as 120 pixels
@0
Answers is "Editable"
Dossier is "Absent"
Report is "No dossier"
@10
Answers is "Editable"
Dossier is "Submitted"
Report is "Pending"
@20
Dossier is "Rejected"
Report is "Feedback"
@30
Answers is "Revised"
@40
Dossier is "Submitted"
Report is "Pending"
@50
Dossier is "Validated"
Report is "Final report"
@60
Answers is "Editable"
@80
Dossier is "Validated"
Report is "Final report"
@10
Answers -> Dossier : copy answers on submit
@40
Answers -> Dossier : replace copy on resubmit
@50
Dossier -> Report : final score + advice
note top of Dossier : Same row reused until validated; event units are illustrative
@enduml
